  "details": "At least as of the prior VCC version (a couple months ago), if the user let VCC download Unity and was away, they would miss the UAC prompt (as it only appears for 2 minutes). This would cause VCC to fail to install unity. Retrying the process would cause VCC to download Unity all over again.\n\nVCC should provide an option to retry with the already-downloaded installer or account for the UAC timeout in its installation process.",
